{"id":"game-11-dungeons-and-bosses","group":"game","groupLabel":"Game Design","number":"11","title":"Dungeons and Bosses","summary":"Defines dungeon roles, encounter structure, boss identity, readability, progression value and replayable challenge.","sourceFile":"Game Design/11 - Dungeons and Bosses.docx","meta":{"status":"DRAFT","version":"0.15.7","owner":"J. Crow","last_updated":"08/20/2026"},"headings":[{"level":1,"text":"1. Dungeon Types"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":2,"text":"Story Dungeon"},{"level":3,"text":"Repeatability"},{"level":3,"text":"Proposed target duration"},{"level":1,"text":"Progression Dungeon"},{"level":3,"text":"Target duration"},{"level":1,"text":"Weekly Dungeon"},{"level":1,"text":"Event Dungeon"},{"level":1,"text":"Challenge Dungeon"},{"level":3,"text":"Rewards"},{"level":1,"text":"Summary classification"},{"level":1,"text":"2. Dungeon Flow"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Entrance"},{"level":1,"text":"Exploration"},{"level":1,"text":"Encounters"},{"level":1,"text":"Puzzle"},{"level":1,"text":"Sub-Boss"},{"level":1,"text":"Respite / Checkpoint"},{"level":1,"text":"Boss"},{"level":1,"text":"Reward"},{"level":1,"text":"Exit"},{"level":3,"text":"Exit"},{"level":3,"text":"Continue Exploring"},{"level":1,"text":"3. Encounter Design"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Skills that can be tested"},{"level":2,"text":"Movement"},{"level":2,"text":"Prioritization"},{"level":2,"text":"Reactions"},{"level":2,"text":"Cooldown management"},{"level":2,"text":"Character switching"},{"level":2,"text":"Enemy reading"},{"level":1,"text":"Difficulty scaling"},{"level":3,"text":"New combinations"},{"level":3,"text":"Greater spatial pressure"},{"level":3,"text":"Additional mechanics"},{"level":3,"text":"Timing"},{"level":3,"text":"Enemy synergies"},{"level":3,"text":"Terrain"},{"level":3,"text":"Elite variants"},{"level":1,"text":"Introduction rule"},{"level":1,"text":"Variety between rooms"},{"level":1,"text":"4. Boss Design Framework"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"Boss fantasy"},{"level":1,"text":"Central mechanic"},{"level":3,"text":"1 main mechanic"},{"level":3,"text":"2–4 secondary mechanics"},{"level":1,"text":"Phases"},{"level":3,"text":"Small Boss"},{"level":3,"text":"Main Boss"},{"level":3,"text":"Major narrative/weekly Boss"},{"level":1,"text":"Telegraphs"},{"level":1,"text":"Damage windows"},{"level":1,"text":"Punishment for mistakes"},{"level":3,"text":"Minor"},{"level":3,"text":"Medium"},{"level":3,"text":"Severe"},{"level":1,"text":"Stagger / Break"},{"level":3,"text":"Break / Stagger Gauge"},{"level":1,"text":"Enrage"},{"level":1,"text":"5. Weekly Bosses"},{"level":2,"text":"Development"},{"level":1,"text":"What makes them replayable"},{"level":2,"text":"Difficulties"},{"level":2,"text":"Weekly modifiers"},{"level":2,"text":"Secondary objectives"},{"level":1,"text":"Rewards"},{"level":1,"text":"Limits"},{"level":1,"text":"Rotation"},{"level":3,"text":"Permanent Bosses"},{"level":3,"text":"Featured Weekly Boss"},{"level":1,"text":"Difficulty"},{"level":1,"text":"6. Vertical Slice Boss"},{"level":1,"text":"Zalenquea Guardian"},{"level":1,"text":"Arena"},{"level":1,"text":"Phase 1: Guardian"},{"level":3,"text":"Frontal strike"},{"level":3,"text":"Terra Barrier"},{"level":3,"text":"Earth Slam"},{"level":3,"text":"Core Exposure"},{"level":1,"text":"Central mechanic"},{"level":2,"text":"TECTONIC ARMOR"},{"level":1,"text":"Phase 2: Changing arena"},{"level":1,"text":"Elemental interaction"},{"level":3,"text":"Water + Earth"},{"level":3,"text":"Cryo + Earth"},{"level":3,"text":"Fire + Earth"},{"level":1,"text":"Adds"},{"level":1,"text":"Climax"},{"level":1,"text":"Systems it should demonstrate"},{"level":3,"text":"Combat"},{"level":3,"text":"Character Gameplay"},{"level":3,"text":"Elements"},{"level":3,"text":"Environment"},{"level":3,"text":"Readability"},{"level":3,"text":"Progression"},{"level":1,"text":"Required art"},{"level":2,"text":"3D Model"},{"level":2,"text":"Minimum animations"},{"level":3,"text":"8–12 main animations"},{"level":1,"text":"VFX"},{"level":3,"text":"Terra"},{"level":3,"text":"Core"},{"level":3,"text":"Telegraphs"},{"level":3,"text":"Reaction Feedback"},{"level":1,"text":"Audio"},{"level":1,"text":"UI"},{"level":3,"text":"Boss Health Bar"},{"level":3,"text":"Name"},{"level":3,"text":"Phase / Core indicator"},{"level":3,"text":"Stagger Gauge"},{"level":3,"text":"Status / Aura icons"},{"level":1,"text":"Vertical Slice Boss reward"},{"level":1,"text":"Why Zalenquea works as a candidate"}],"blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SYMPHONIA IUSTITIAE"},{"type":"title","text":"11 - Dungeons and Bosses"},{"type":"p","text":"Encounter, Level, and Boss Design"},{"type":"table","table":0},{"type":"h1","text":"1. Dungeon Types"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"The Dungeons of Symphony of Justice are concentrated content spaces where exploration, combat, puzzles, narrative, and progression can be combined with greater intensity than in the open world."},{"type":"p","text":"Not every Dungeon needs to exist to provide materials."},{"type":"p","text":"Their function may be:"},{"type":"p","text":"TELL → CHALLENGE → TEACH → REWARD → TEST"},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documentation already proposes that a Dungeon may be associated with a story, element, or nation, and that its route may progressively become a more complex maze."},{"type":"p","text":"I propose five main categories."},{"type":"h2","text":"Story Dungeon"},{"type":"p","text":"It forms part of:"},{"type":"p","text":"Main Story;"},{"type":"p","text":"World Mission;"},{"type":"p","text":"Character Mission;"},{"type":"p","text":"important narrative events."},{"type":"p","text":"Its priority is:"},{"type":"p","text":"narrative + atmosphere + gameplay."},{"type":"p","text":"It may contain:"},{"type":"p","text":"dialogue;"},{"type":"p","text":"scenes;"},{"type":"p","text":"exploration;"},{"type":"p","text":"puzzles;"},{"type":"p","text":"encounters;"},{"type":"p","text":"Boss."},{"type":"h3","text":"Repeatability"},{"type":"p","text":"It generally does not need to be repeated to obtain resources. A Replay Mode may later exist without the main rewards."},{"type":"h3","text":"Proposed target duration"},{"type":"p","text":"20–40 minutes."},{"type":"h1","text":"Progression Dungeon"},{"type":"p","text":"Designed primarily to obtain specific resources."},{"type":"p","text":"It may specialize in:"},{"type":"p","text":"EXP;"},{"type":"p","text":"talent materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"weapons;"},{"type":"p","text":"artifacts;"},{"type":"p","text":"elemental materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"profession resources."},{"type":"p","text":"It should be considerably shorter than a narrative Dungeon."},{"type":"h3","text":"Target duration"},{"type":"p","text":"5–12 minutes."},{"type":"p","text":"The idea is:"},{"type":"p","text":"enter → overcome challenge → receive material → leave."},{"type":"p","text":"We do not want to force the player through twenty minutes of corridors every time they need three talent books."},{"type":"h1","text":"Weekly Dungeon"},{"type":"p","text":"This category comes directly from the historical documentation."},{"type":"p","text":"Weekly Dungeons are conceived as:"},{"type":"p","text":"progressive routes;"},{"type":"p","text":"increasing difficulty;"},{"type":"p","text":"variable themes;"},{"type":"p","text":"a maze component;"},{"type":"p","text":"their own narrative;"},{"type":"p","text":"content related to the Kingdomless Island."},{"type":"p","text":"I propose that their modern version work through:"},{"type":"p","text":"SECTIONS → ROUTE CHOICE → MODIFIERS → ENCOUNTERS → BOSS"},{"type":"p","text":"Each week may change:"},{"type":"p","text":"room combinations;"},{"type":"p","text":"modifiers;"},{"type":"p","text":"enemies;"},{"type":"p","text":"featured reward;"},{"type":"p","text":"special conditions."},{"type":"p","text":"The entire Dungeon does not necessarily need to be procedurally generated. We can build hand-designed modules and rearrange them using controlled rules."},{"type":"h1","text":"Event Dungeon"},{"type":"p","text":"It appears temporarily during an update. It may experiment with mechanics that are not part of the permanent game."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"p","text":"altered gravity;"},{"type":"p","text":"enemies with special rules;"},{"type":"p","text":"time limit;"},{"type":"p","text":"themed puzzles;"},{"type":"p","text":"Trial characters;"},{"type":"p","text":"elemental modifications."},{"type":"p","text":"Its main function is: variety."},{"type":"p","text":"This aligns with the historical philosophy of events, which sought to alter mechanics to avoid monotony."},{"type":"h1","text":"Challenge Dungeon"},{"type":"p","text":"It is designed to test:"},{"type":"p","text":"character mastery;"},{"type":"p","text":"composition;"},{"type":"p","text":"execution;"},{"type":"p","text":"reactions;"},{"type":"p","text":"enemy knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"It may contain:"},{"type":"p","text":"optional time limit;"},{"type":"p","text":"scalable difficulty;"},{"type":"p","text":"restrictions;"},{"type":"p","text":"modifiers;"},{"type":"p","text":"elite encounters;"},{"type":"p","text":"Boss Rush."},{"type":"p","text":"It should not be required to complete the story."},{"type":"h3","text":"Rewards"},{"type":"p","text":"Primarily:"},{"type":"p","text":"advanced resources;"},{"type":"p","text":"cosmetics;"},{"type":"p","text":"titles;"},{"type":"p","text":"achievements;"},{"type":"p","text":"prestige items."},{"type":"h1","text":"Summary classification"},{"type":"table","table":1},{"type":"h1","text":"2. Dungeon Flow"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"A complete Dungeon may use the following structure:"},{"type":"p","text":"ENTRANCE → EXPLORATION → ENCOUNTER → PUZZLE / DECISION → COMPLEX ENCOUNTER → SUB-BOSS → RESPITE → BOSS → REWARD / EXIT"},{"type":"p","text":"Not all of them need to use every stage."},{"type":"h1","text":"Entrance"},{"type":"p","text":"The entrance should communicate:"},{"type":"p","text":"name;"},{"type":"p","text":"theme;"},{"type":"p","text":"recommended difficulty;"},{"type":"p","text":"rewards;"},{"type":"p","text":"conditions;"},{"type":"p","text":"special restrictions."},{"type":"p","text":"The player may:"},{"type":"p","text":"review equipment;"},{"type":"p","text":"change characters;"},{"type":"p","text":"use consumables;"},{"type":"p","text":"understand the objective."},{"type":"p","text":"Once inside, there should be a clear starting point."},{"type":"h1","text":"Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"The player discovers the Dungeon's identity."},{"type":"p","text":"It may include:"},{"type":"p","text":"side routes;"},{"type":"p","text":"resources;"},{"type":"p","text":"lore;"},{"type":"p","text":"items;"},{"type":"p","text":"structures;"},{"type":"p","text":"hazards;"},{"type":"p","text":"signs of the Boss."},{"type":"p","text":"Especially in narrative and weekly Dungeons, the route should tell a story. The historical document specifically proposes that the appeal of Dungeons should come not only from defeating enemies, but also from the story associated with them."},{"type":"h1","text":"Encounters"},{"type":"p","text":"The first enemies introduce the rules of the location."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"If the Dungeon is based on electricity and water:"},{"type":"p","text":"the first encounter teaches conductive zones;"},{"type":"p","text":"the second combines Electro enemies;"},{"type":"p","text":"later, the Boss uses the same rule on a larger scale."},{"type":"h1","text":"Puzzle"},{"type":"p","text":"It breaks the combat rhythm."},{"type":"p","text":"It may use:"},{"type":"p","text":"elements;"},{"type":"p","text":"the environment;"},{"type":"p","text":"patterns;"},{"type":"p","text":"regional mechanisms;"},{"type":"p","text":"professions;"},{"type":"p","text":"navigation."},{"type":"p","text":"It should not appear merely to add minutes. It must reinforce the theme."},{"type":"h1","text":"Sub-Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"The Sub-Boss represents an intermediate test."},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documentation already has a specific Sub-Boss category, including Bibliothecae Fungi, Dragons, Yo-Kai, Vampire, Hunter Shinigami, Knights, Whisper Trees, and others."},{"type":"p","text":"Its function is to:"},{"type":"p","text":"introduce an advanced mechanic;"},{"type":"p","text":"check understanding;"},{"type":"p","text":"change the pace;"},{"type":"p","text":"foreshadow concepts used by the Boss."},{"type":"h1","text":"Respite / Checkpoint"},{"type":"p","text":"After the Sub-Boss or before the Boss, there should be a short break."},{"type":"p","text":"It allows the player to:"},{"type":"p","text":"partially heal;"},{"type":"p","text":"reorganize equipment;"},{"type":"p","text":"review items;"},{"type":"p","text":"read lore;"},{"type":"p","text":"activate a checkpoint."},{"type":"p","text":"Especially in long Dungeons. I do not recommend forcing the player to repeat an entire 30-minute Dungeon because they lost to the Boss."},{"type":"h1","text":"Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"It concentrates the rules learned. It should require:"},{"type":"p","text":"reading + movement + execution + composition + reaction"},{"type":"p","text":"and not merely statistics."},{"type":"h1","text":"Reward"},{"type":"p","text":"After defeating the Boss:"},{"type":"p","text":"main reward;"},{"type":"p","text":"currency;"},{"type":"p","text":"materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"Codex;"},{"type":"p","text":"narrative progress;"},{"type":"p","text":"special item."},{"type":"p","text":"There should be a clear sense of closure."},{"type":"h1","text":"Exit"},{"type":"p","text":"It may offer:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Exit"},{"type":"p","text":"return directly."},{"type":"h3","text":"Continue Exploring"},{"type":"p","text":"when compatible with the Dungeon."},{"type":"p","text":"This avoids immediately removing the player if they still want to investigate a side route."},{"type":"h1","text":"3. Encounter Design"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Each encounter should answer one question: What player skill are we testing?"},{"type":"p","text":"Not every enemy needs to test everything simultaneously."},{"type":"h1","text":"Skills that can be tested"},{"type":"h2","text":"Movement"},{"type":"p","text":"dodging;"},{"type":"p","text":"positioning;"},{"type":"p","text":"pursuit;"},{"type":"p","text":"separation."},{"type":"h2","text":"Prioritization"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"enemy healer;"},{"type":"p","text":"summoner;"},{"type":"p","text":"gunner;"},{"type":"p","text":"tank."},{"type":"p","text":"The player decides: who should die first?"},{"type":"h2","text":"Reactions"},{"type":"p","text":"An encounter may be designed to favor:"},{"type":"p","text":"control;"},{"type":"p","text":"terrain creation;"},{"type":"p","text":"break;"},{"type":"p","text":"amplification;"},{"type":"p","text":"persistent damage."},{"type":"p","text":"Without requiring a single specific reaction."},{"type":"h2","text":"Cooldown management"},{"type":"p","text":"In the real-time RPG we are consolidating, a fundamental decision will be: use now vs. save for later."},{"type":"h2","text":"Character switching"},{"type":"p","text":"If the active system uses one controlled character and quick switching, certain encounters may encourage:"},{"type":"p","text":"apply → switch → react → capitalize."},{"type":"h2","text":"Enemy reading"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"p","text":"telegraph;"},{"type":"p","text":"window;"},{"type":"p","text":"weak point;"},{"type":"p","text":"status;"},{"type":"p","text":"intent."},{"type":"h1","text":"Difficulty scaling"},{"type":"p","text":"It should not be based only on:"},{"type":"p","text":"HP × 4."},{"type":"p","text":"Difficulty may increase through:"},{"type":"h3","text":"New combinations"},{"type":"p","text":"Two known enemies together."},{"type":"h3","text":"Greater spatial pressure"},{"type":"p","text":"Fewer safe zones."},{"type":"h3","text":"Additional mechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"The enemy gains a second ability."},{"type":"h3","text":"Timing"},{"type":"p","text":"Shorter windows."},{"type":"h3","text":"Enemy synergies"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"A Guardian protects a Healer."},{"type":"h3","text":"Terrain"},{"type":"p","text":"Environmental hazards."},{"type":"h3","text":"Elite variants"},{"type":"p","text":"The same family with advanced behavior."},{"type":"h1","text":"Introduction rule"},{"type":"p","text":"Difficulty should follow:"},{"type":"p","text":"INTRODUCE → COMBINE → PRESSURE → EXAMINE"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Room 1: an enemy that charges."},{"type":"p","text":"Room 2: an enemy that creates a barrier."},{"type":"p","text":"Room 3: both together."},{"type":"p","text":"Sub-Boss: charge + barrier + elemental zone."},{"type":"p","text":"Boss: combines everything within one central mechanic."},{"type":"h1","text":"Variety between rooms"},{"type":"p","text":"Rooms should not be: square → five enemies → door → square → five enemies."},{"type":"p","text":"They may include:"},{"type":"p","text":"open arena;"},{"type":"p","text":"corridor;"},{"type":"p","text":"verticality;"},{"type":"p","text":"hazards;"},{"type":"p","text":"stationary enemies;"},{"type":"p","text":"pursuit;"},{"type":"p","text":"defense;"},{"type":"p","text":"puzzle-combat;"},{"type":"p","text":"miniboss;"},{"type":"p","text":"destructible arena."},{"type":"h1","text":"4. Boss Design Framework"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Each Boss should be designed around a central fantasy."},{"type":"p","text":"Not around: “we need an enemy with 2 million HP.”"},{"type":"h1","text":"Boss fantasy"},{"type":"p","text":"One sentence that defines what it feels like to face it."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Fight a living prison that tries to progressively reduce your space.”"},{"type":"p","text":"“Face a dragon built from the souls that could not leave the world.”"},{"type":"p","text":"“Survive a war machine that learns from the elements used against it.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Everything else should reinforce that idea."},{"type":"h1","text":"Central mechanic"},{"type":"p","text":"Each Boss should have:"},{"type":"h3","text":"1 main mechanic"},{"type":"p","text":"that is easy to explain."},{"type":"p","text":"And approximately:"},{"type":"h3","text":"2–4 secondary mechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"that develop it."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Main mechanic: chains."},{"type":"p","text":"Secondary mechanics:"},{"type":"p","text":"chain the player;"},{"type":"p","text":"connect characters;"},{"type":"p","text":"close off the arena;"},{"type":"p","text":"break chains to create a window."},{"type":"p","text":"This creates coherence."},{"type":"h1","text":"Phases"},{"type":"p","text":"Not every Boss needs three phases because “Bosses have three phases.”"},{"type":"p","text":"I propose:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Small Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"1 phase + variation."},{"type":"h3","text":"Main Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"2 phases."},{"type":"h3","text":"Major narrative/weekly Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"2–3 phases."},{"type":"p","text":"A new phase should introduce a new decision, not merely fill another health bar."},{"type":"h1","text":"Telegraphs"},{"type":"p","text":"Every dangerous attack needs a proportional warning."},{"type":"p","text":"It may use:"},{"type":"p","text":"animation;"},{"type":"p","text":"VFX;"},{"type":"p","text":"sound;"},{"type":"p","text":"ground;"},{"type":"p","text":"stance;"},{"type":"p","text":"voice;"},{"type":"p","text":"iconography."},{"type":"p","text":"The greater the punishment, the clearer the telegraph."},{"type":"p","text":"The player should think: “I saw it and reacted too late.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Not: “What the hell killed me?”"},{"type":"h1","text":"Damage windows"},{"type":"p","text":"The Boss should not be permanently vulnerable in the same way."},{"type":"p","text":"Windows may arise by:"},{"type":"p","text":"breaking posture;"},{"type":"p","text":"interrupting;"},{"type":"p","text":"destroying an object;"},{"type":"p","text":"triggering a reaction;"},{"type":"p","text":"resolving a mechanic;"},{"type":"p","text":"dodging a sequence;"},{"type":"p","text":"attacking a weak point."},{"type":"p","text":"Then: DEFEND / RESOLVE → CREATE WINDOW → OFFENSE"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a more interesting rhythm."},{"type":"h1","text":"Punishment for mistakes"},{"type":"p","text":"The punishment may be:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Minor"},{"type":"p","text":"damage;"},{"type":"p","text":"knockback;"},{"type":"p","text":"debuff."},{"type":"h3","text":"Medium"},{"type":"p","text":"lost window;"},{"type":"p","text":"Boss recovers a resource;"},{"type":"p","text":"player is left exposed."},{"type":"h3","text":"Severe"},{"type":"p","text":"character is defeated;"},{"type":"p","text":"phase restarts."},{"type":"p","text":"I would avoid: one-shots without a clear telegraph."},{"type":"h1","text":"Stagger / Break"},{"type":"p","text":"I propose that Bosses have some type of:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Break / Stagger Gauge"},{"type":"p","text":"certain actions may reduce it:"},{"type":"p","text":"hits;"},{"type":"p","text":"reactions;"},{"type":"p","text":"weak points;"},{"type":"p","text":"mechanics."},{"type":"p","text":"When it breaks: Damage Window."},{"type":"p","text":"This works very well with the Action RPG and allows elements, physical abilities, and team composition to contribute toward the same objective."},{"type":"h1","text":"Enrage"},{"type":"p","text":"It may exist as a soft limit in certain challenge activities. But not every story Boss needs a hidden timer."},{"type":"h1","text":"5. Weekly Bosses"},{"type":"h2","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documentation explicitly identifies three Weekly Bosses:"},{"type":"p","text":"Arz. Goetia"},{"type":"p","text":"The Dragon of Phantom Souls"},{"type":"p","text":"Train of the Exiled"},{"type":"p","text":"Their kits are not yet described in enough detail in the sources, so we should not invent them as CANON in this document. We can, however, define how the Weekly Boss category will work."},{"type":"h1","text":"What makes them replayable"},{"type":"p","text":"Replayability should not depend solely on repeating exactly the same fight."},{"type":"p","text":"It may introduce:"},{"type":"h2","text":"Difficulties"},{"type":"p","text":"Normal → Hard → Extreme, or thematic names later."},{"type":"h2","text":"Weekly modifiers"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"p","text":"certain reactions are amplified;"},{"type":"p","text":"the Boss gains an attack variant;"},{"type":"p","text":"different hazards appear;"},{"type":"p","text":"the composition of adds changes."},{"type":"p","text":"Not too many at once."},{"type":"h2","text":"Secondary objectives"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"defeat it without any characters falling;"},{"type":"p","text":"break a specific part;"},{"type":"p","text":"produce X Stagger;"},{"type":"p","text":"complete an optional mechanic."},{"type":"p","text":"These may grant bonuses, but should not block the main reward."},{"type":"h1","text":"Rewards"},{"type":"p","text":"The historical documentation associates weekly content with Character Upgrade Materials, harder-to-obtain equipment, and gear structured differently from conventional sets."},{"type":"p","text":"They may also provide:"},{"type":"p","text":"advanced materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"talent materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"rare crafting materials;"},{"type":"p","text":"currency;"},{"type":"p","text":"exceptional cosmetics."},{"type":"h1","text":"Limits"},{"type":"p","text":"I recommend limiting the number of advanced rewards that can be claimed, not the number of attempts."},{"type":"p","text":"The player may repeat it to:"},{"type":"p","text":"practice;"},{"type":"p","text":"experiment;"},{"type":"p","text":"improve their time."},{"type":"p","text":"But they receive advanced drops only a controlled number of times."},{"type":"h1","text":"Rotation"},{"type":"p","text":"I would not rotate Bosses weekly to the point that one disappears."},{"type":"p","text":"A better structure:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Permanent Bosses"},{"type":"p","text":"Always available."},{"type":"h3","text":"Featured Weekly Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"One or more receive:"},{"type":"p","text":"bonus;"},{"type":"p","text":"challenge;"},{"type":"p","text":"modifier;"},{"type":"p","text":"additional reward."},{"type":"p","text":"This way, a player who needs a specific material never has to wait three weeks for the correct Boss to return."},{"type":"h1","text":"Difficulty"},{"type":"p","text":"The player may select levels based on progress. The first difficulty allows them to learn."},{"type":"p","text":"Higher difficulties:"},{"type":"p","text":"modify mechanics;"},{"type":"p","text":"improve rewards;"},{"type":"p","text":"require mastery."},{"type":"h1","text":"6. Vertical Slice Boss"},{"type":"p","text":"This point does require a new production decision. The documents do not explicitly define which Boss should be used for the Vertical Slice. Therefore, I propose not immediately creating an entirely new narrative character. We can use a historical Boss and provisionally turn it into a Vertical Slice Boss Candidate."},{"type":"p","text":"My candidate would be:"},{"type":"h1","text":"Zalenquea Guardian"},{"type":"p","text":"The historical source already identifies it as an Evolution Boss associated with Terra/Earth. We still do not know its definitive story, appearance, or kit."},{"type":"h1","text":"Arena"},{"type":"p","text":"A partially destroyed circular chamber or ruin."},{"type":"p","text":"Elements:"},{"type":"p","text":"columns;"},{"type":"p","text":"platforms;"},{"type":"p","text":"areas of fractured earth;"},{"type":"p","text":"central core;"},{"type":"p","text":"structures that can rise."},{"type":"p","text":"It does not need to be enormous."},{"type":"p","text":"It should allow clear readability."},{"type":"h1","text":"Phase 1: Guardian"},{"type":"p","text":"The Boss uses:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Frontal strike"},{"type":"p","text":"Long telegraph."},{"type":"p","text":"Test: dodge."},{"type":"h3","text":"Terra Barrier"},{"type":"p","text":"Raises walls."},{"type":"p","text":"Test: positioning."},{"type":"h3","text":"Earth Slam"},{"type":"p","text":"Creates a ground wave."},{"type":"p","text":"Test: distance / jump / dodge."},{"type":"h3","text":"Core Exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"After certain actions, a core is briefly exposed."},{"type":"p","text":"Test: recognize the window."},{"type":"h1","text":"Central mechanic"},{"type":"h2","text":"TECTONIC ARMOR"},{"type":"p","text":"The Guardian has stone plates."},{"type":"p","text":"Normal attacks damage them slowly."},{"type":"p","text":"Reactions and Stagger allow them to be broken more efficiently."},{"type":"p","text":"When a plate breaks, a weak point opens."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates:"},{"type":"p","text":"physical damage;"},{"type":"p","text":"elements;"},{"type":"p","text":"reactions;"},{"type":"p","text":"stagger;"},{"type":"p","text":"weak points."},{"type":"h1","text":"Phase 2: Changing arena"},{"type":"p","text":"When its HP drops, the Boss rearranges the terrain."},{"type":"p","text":"It may:"},{"type":"p","text":"raise walls;"},{"type":"p","text":"divide the arena;"},{"type":"p","text":"create hazardous zones;"},{"type":"p","text":"close routes."},{"type":"p","text":"Now the player must combine: movement + reading + character switching + reactions."},{"type":"h1","text":"Elemental interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"We can prepare specific areas of the arena to demonstrate the system we have already designed."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Water + Earth"},{"type":"p","text":"Quicksand"},{"type":"p","text":"reduces the mobility of part of the Boss or its adds."},{"type":"h3","text":"Cryo + Earth"},{"type":"p","text":"Barriers"},{"type":"p","text":"may create cover or modify structures."},{"type":"h3","text":"Fire + Earth"},{"type":"p","text":"Magma"},{"type":"p","text":"creates an offensive zone."},{"type":"p","text":"We do not need to implement all 42 reactions."},{"type":"p","text":"The Vertical Slice only needs:"},{"type":"p","text":"2–4 impeccably readable reactions."},{"type":"h1","text":"Adds"},{"type":"p","text":"During Phase 2, 1–2 small enemies may appear."},{"type":"p","text":"Not a huge wave."},{"type":"p","text":"Their function is to:"},{"type":"p","text":"create pressure;"},{"type":"p","text":"force prioritization;"},{"type":"p","text":"allow resources to recharge."},{"type":"h1","text":"Climax"},{"type":"p","text":"With the armor completely broken: CORE BREAK"},{"type":"p","text":"The Guardian becomes vulnerable during a significant window."},{"type":"p","text":"The player uses:"},{"type":"p","text":"Skill;"},{"type":"p","text":"character switch;"},{"type":"p","text":"reaction;"},{"type":"p","text":"Ultimate."},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a small fantasy of: prepare → break → execute."},{"type":"h1","text":"Systems it should demonstrate"},{"type":"p","text":"The Vertical Slice Boss should test:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Combat"},{"type":"p","text":"real-time attack;"},{"type":"p","text":"dodge;"},{"type":"p","text":"cooldown;"},{"type":"p","text":"Ultimate."},{"type":"h3","text":"Character Gameplay"},{"type":"p","text":"character switching;"},{"type":"p","text":"roles;"},{"type":"p","text":"individual mechanics."},{"type":"h3","text":"Elements"},{"type":"p","text":"Aura;"},{"type":"p","text":"Reaction;"},{"type":"p","text":"visual effect."},{"type":"h3","text":"Environment"},{"type":"p","text":"terrain;"},{"type":"p","text":"barriers;"},{"type":"p","text":"hazard."},{"type":"h3","text":"Readability"},{"type":"p","text":"telegraphs;"},{"type":"p","text":"weak points;"},{"type":"p","text":"statuses;"},{"type":"p","text":"health bar;"},{"type":"p","text":"stagger."},{"type":"h3","text":"Progression"},{"type":"p","text":"reward after the encounter."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the Boss can function almost like the final exam of the Vertical Slice."},{"type":"h1","text":"Required art"},{"type":"h2","text":"3D Model"},{"type":"p","text":"We need:"},{"type":"p","text":"main body;"},{"type":"p","text":"core;"},{"type":"p","text":"breakable plates;"},{"type":"p","text":"arms/weapon, if applicable."},{"type":"p","text":"I would not design ten transformations yet."},{"type":"h2","text":"Minimum animations"},{"type":"p","text":"Idle;"},{"type":"p","text":"locomotion;"},{"type":"p","text":"basic attack;"},{"type":"p","text":"Slam;"},{"type":"p","text":"barrier;"},{"type":"p","text":"special attack;"},{"type":"p","text":"stagger;"},{"type":"p","text":"phase transition;"},{"type":"p","text":"break;"},{"type":"p","text":"death."},{"type":"p","text":"Approximately:"},{"type":"h3","text":"8–12 main animations"},{"type":"p","text":"plus blends/transitions."},{"type":"h1","text":"VFX"},{"type":"h3","text":"Terra"},{"type":"p","text":"fragments;"},{"type":"p","text":"dust;"},{"type":"p","text":"cracks;"},{"type":"p","text":"walls."},{"type":"h3","text":"Core"},{"type":"p","text":"A distinct visual identity to communicate vulnerability."},{"type":"h3","text":"Telegraphs"},{"type":"p","text":"frontal area;"},{"type":"p","text":"wave;"},{"type":"p","text":"ground hazard."},{"type":"h3","text":"Reaction Feedback"},{"type":"p","text":"The Slice's 2–4 reactions."},{"type":"h1","text":"Audio"},{"type":"p","text":"Needed for:"},{"type":"p","text":"heavy footsteps;"},{"type":"p","text":"stone;"},{"type":"p","text":"impacts;"},{"type":"p","text":"activation;"},{"type":"p","text":"Core;"},{"type":"p","text":"phase transition;"},{"type":"p","text":"stagger;"},{"type":"p","text":"death."},{"type":"p","text":"Sound should contribute to telegraphs."},{"type":"h1","text":"UI"},{"type":"p","text":"It needs:"},{"type":"h3","text":"Boss Health Bar"},{"type":"h3","text":"Name"},{"type":"h3","text":"Phase / Core indicator"},{"type":"h3","text":"Stagger Gauge"},{"type":"h3","text":"Status / Aura icons"},{"type":"h1","text":"Vertical Slice Boss reward"},{"type":"p","text":"After defeating it:"},{"type":"p","text":"Evolution material;"},{"type":"p","text":"currency;"},{"type":"p","text":"an upgrade;"},{"type":"p","text":"Codex entry;"},{"type":"p","text":"narrative fragment."},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally, one of these resources is used before the demo ends to close the loop: BOSS → REWARD → UPGRADE and demonstrate the Core Loop."},{"type":"h1","text":"Why Zalenquea works as a candidate"},{"type":"p","text":"Not because we already know it will be the final Boss, but because it technically allows us to demonstrate almost everything important:"},{"type":"p","text":"MOVEMENT + COMBAT + ELEMENTS + REACTIONS + TERRAIN + READABILITY + REWARDS"},{"type":"p","text":"without yet requiring us to reveal one of the story's main antagonists. That is useful for a Vertical Slice."},{"type":"p","text":"We can show how Symphony of Justice works without spoiling a scene that should have an impact twenty hours later."}],"tables":[[["Status","DRAFT","Version","0.15.7"],["Owner","J. Crow","Last updated","08/20/2026"]],[["Type","Main priority","Repeatable","Proposed duration"],["Story","Narrative + gameplay","Usually no","20–40 min"],["Progression","Resources","Yes","5–12 min"],["Weekly","Variety + challenge","Yes","20–35 min"],["Event","Experimentation","During event","Variable"],["Challenge","Mastery","Yes","10–30 min"]]]}